Conflicts: grommunio-dav
Replaces: grommunio-dav
Provides: grommunio-dav
Description: CalDAV/CardDAV server for Gromox (Office Unbound build)
 grommunio-dav (sabre/dav based) exposes calendars, tasks and contacts of
 Gromox mailboxes over CalDAV/CardDAV. Application tree in
 /usr/share/grommunio-dav including the composer vendor tree (locked
 versions, see the package SBOM), configuration in
 /etc/grommunio-dav/config.php (conffile). nginx and php-fpm snippets are
 shipped as examples under /usr/share/doc/ou-grommunio-dav/examples.
